[nomarkup][As you enter the bathroom to take the shower you promised yourself you get paralyzed. Diego's body still there, prompting again bad memories in your head rewind like a horror. With your full memories from the night before it's even more devastating to look at the guys face.][/nomarkup] #line:0ffefec 
{$pcName}: Dammit... #line:067a3ce 
<<if GetIsPartyMemberRecruited($anastasia) is true>>
    {$anastasia}: [nomarkup][She pushes past you.][/nomarkup] Who the fuck is this guy? #line:0f6d936 
    -> {$pcName}: It's… it appears it's my first victim. #line:04fa137 
    {$anastasia}: Well that's tough. [nomarkup][She looks around and then focuses her gaze on you.][/nomarkup] Did you want to take a shower? #line:06efcdd 
    -> {$pcName}: Yes. #line:0dc8bef 
    {$anastasia}: Do you need help with this guy? #line:0103150 
    -> {$pcName}: Yes. #line:0e946bb 
        <<jump anaTakesBody>>
    -> {$pcName}: No. I have to do it myself. It's my mess. #line:0bdf1b7 
        <<jump pcTakesBody>>
<<else>>
    [nomarkup][You have no other choice then to deal with the body yourself.][/nomarkup] #line:01d3cc7 
        <<jump pcTakesBody>>
<<endif>>
